  "policy_notes": [
    "Enemy hero current-turn pricing counts each settled positive damage packet once, including armor, independently of source ownership; zero, prevented and converted-to-healing packets do not count. CN packet/timing policy remains uncalibrated.",
    "No-minion pricing captures both original boards; locations and inert interactables do not count, while dormant ordinary minions do.",
    "Enemy-board pricing and own-all-hand pricing reuse existing complete zone operands; own-all-hand includes the physical submitted spell, or one additional hypothetical subject in a generated quote.",
    "Spell damage and character attack prices reuse existing actual spell damage units and original attack declarations. CN source credit and interrupted attack policy remain uncalibrated.",
    "All six roots and the one actual summoned Dragon dependency are implemented as complete effects; the registered subset is not a formal generation pool."
